{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/949a195d0fe11fead170882ac1e1e67d.poster.avif?t=1752635405\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/949a195d0fe11fead170882ac1e1e67d.webm?t=1752635405\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/949a195d0fe11fead170882ac1e1e67d.mp4?t=1752635405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Langit Lupa: Fast-paced multiplayer chase game set in an office environment, inspired by a classic Filipino childhood game, where you leap across desks and chairs to avoid the floor and outmaneuver your coworkers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/af52fa0dd32efe8a275e5b0afb9d61b7.poster.avif?t=1752635405\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/af52fa0dd32efe8a275e5b0afb9d61b7.webm?t=1752635405\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/af52fa0dd32efe8a275e5b0afb9d61b7.mp4?t=1752635405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Desks, chairs, and random office supplies have never been so fun to climb, throw, or dodge. Who knew staplers could be so dangerous?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/247f622a1ddedb20267c3186e35028ec.poster.avif?t=1752635405\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/247f622a1ddedb20267c3186e35028ec.webm?t=1752635405\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/247f622a1ddedb20267c3186e35028ec.mp4?t=1752635405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your buddies, open a private lobby, and get your betrayal game on. Punch or hurl random objects at your pals\u2014even if they\u2019re not the tagger\u2014because who needs trust when you can have utter pandemonium?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/95dfe4a013ca86c6ed363234763f219b.poster.avif?t=1752635405\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/95dfe4a013ca86c6ed363234763f219b.webm?t=1752635405\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/95dfe4a013ca86c6ed363234763f219b.mp4?t=1752635405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh yeah, why not make everything you see throwable?<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/e7591209257dd071fb89e7867ccbdcb1.poster.avif?t=1752635405\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/e7591209257dd071fb89e7867ccbdcb1.webm?t=1752635405\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/e7591209257dd071fb89e7867ccbdcb1.mp4?t=1752635405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple controls. No mouse required for this one\u2014just use WASD to move and J to tag. Everything else is optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raise to 11 Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 Game Modes (Langit Lupa, 21, Ice-ice Water, Agawan Base, Labo-labo, Capture the Flag,\u00a0Pass the Bomb, Lipat Bayan, Claygo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 to 8 players</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863860?t=1752635405","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863860?t=1752635405","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/9c0216bf89697e1cea5f8b450e3805a03c2a33f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752635405","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/9c0216bf89697e1cea5f8b450e3805a03c2a33f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752635405","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/949a195d0fe11fead170882ac1e1e67d.poster.avif?t=1752635405\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/949a195d0fe11fead170882ac1e1e67d.webm?t=1752635405\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/949a195d0fe11fead170882ac1e1e67d.mp4?t=1752635405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Langit Lupa: Fast-paced multiplayer chase game set in an office environment, inspired by a classic Filipino childhood game, where you leap across desks and chairs to avoid the floor an