item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/95dfe4a013ca86c6ed363234763f219b.webm?t=1752635405\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/95dfe4a013ca86c6ed363234763f219b.mp4?t=1752635405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh yeah, why not make everything you see throwable?<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/e7591209257dd071fb89e7867ccbdcb1.poster.avif?t=1752635405\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/e7591209257dd071fb89e7867ccbdcb1.webm?t=1752635405\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/extras/e7591209257dd071fb89e7867ccbdcb1.mp4?t=1752635405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple controls. No mouse required for this one\u2014just use WASD to move and J to tag. Everything else is optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raise to 11 Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 Game Modes (Langit Lupa, 21, Ice-ice Water, Agawan Base, Labo-labo, Capture the Flag,\u00a0Pass the Bomb, Lipat Bayan, Claygo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 to 8 players</p></li></ul>","developers":["NinetySix Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3428410","name":"Langit Lupa: Office Series"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863860/41a5e9facd6ba5156c8d387336420bef0cacd13f/header.jpg?t=1752635405","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\